---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout title="Privacy" description="Privacy information for The Dead Air Archive.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p>
        This site does not intentionally collect analytics or track visitors. If the contact form
        is enabled, submissions are processed by Netlify's form service.
      </p>
      <p>
        When you use the Dead Air release-email signup form, the optional name and email address
        you provide are sent directly to AWeber to manage the mailing list and deliver the emails
        you requested. Dead Air does not add UTM or referrer fields to the signup form. AWeber may
        record standard delivery and email-engagement information as part of its mailing service.
        You can unsubscribe using the link provided in any mailing.
      </p>
      <p>
        Please do not send confidential or identifying information through the contact form.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
